{"id":"Wb5d57d4bd2962dc16c5ad81a","zh":"能量阈值","en":"","name":"能量阈值","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wb5d57d4bd2962dc16c5ad81a","text":"能量阈值","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S11a5052a1522a35434c3","source_id":"P102","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"为实现轨道病害的时-频域分析,通过对轨道不平顺或机车振动能量在时间-尺度域进行网格划分及能量计算,设定合适的能量阈值,可以实现轨道不平顺和列车振动信号最不利突变能量的三维分析。","citations":[{"source_id":"P102","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"Sd7a6111c0aa19c56515a","source_id":"P109","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"另外,由于轨道不平顺幅值沿空间里程基本满足正态分布[15−16],根据正态随机变量超过其均值与3 倍均方差之和的小概率原理,可设定相应的能量阈值用于判别轨道特征波长的存在,这些构成轨道不平顺波长提取的基本原理。","citations":[{"source_id":"P109","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P102":{"id":"P102","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,徐伟昌,李晓建,孟宪洪,唐永康","year":"2014","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2014.04.015","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection"},"P109":{"id":"P109","title":"铁路轨道不平顺波长及病害波形的定位方法","authors":"徐磊,高建敏,翟婉明,陈宪麦","year":"2017","doi":"10.11817/j.issn.1672-7207.2017.11.029","journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-localization-methods-for-track-irregularity-wavelengths-and-track-diseases"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"按文中正态分布假定设置、用于筛选大能量事件的界线。","language":"zh","source_id":"P102","paper_slug":"2014-wavelet-energy-spectrum-track-inspection","title":"小波能量谱在铁路轨道检测中的应用","kind":"paper_usage"},{"text":"判定目标波长或病害出现的能量界限，本文以小概率原则近似确定。","language":"zh","source_id":"P109","paper_slug":"2017-localization-methods-for-track-irregularity-wavelengths-and-track-diseases","title":"铁路轨道不平顺波长及病害波形的定位方法",